WEBVTT

00:00:00.550 --> 00:00:05.360
Part five: spots the coordinators fill. You can offer to take one.

00:00:06.210 --> 00:00:10.648
Spots like Critique are filled by the coordinators. Tap Put my name in.

00:00:10.848 --> 00:00:13.622
Add a note if it helps, like what you've done before,

00:00:13.822 --> 00:00:15.580
then tap who.

00:00:16.430 --> 00:00:25.113
Your name is in. It doesn't hold the spot, and it doesn't count toward your shifts until the coordinators place you. So keep signing up for what you owe.

00:00:25.313 --> 00:00:28.180
Changed your mind? Take your name out.

00:00:29.030 --> 00:00:37.130
If you're placed, it shows up here as a normal shift. If someone else is picked, you get an email with a link to the open shifts.

00:00:37.980 --> 00:00:45.200
That's the whole series. Questions? Email the coordinators from the bottom of any S O S Crew page.
